                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27d9be40-6317-3017-8274-5296819cc259",
                        "entry_id": "40d533cf-dfa6-3205-a556-7e34e5bb72ba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een fiets met een elektrische motor"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27b6a01f-6f1f-4ee5-bf5a-0c8f6bd9c3bf",
                                "sense_id": "27d9be40-6317-3017-8274-5296819cc259",
                                "text": "Bij een e-bike behaald de trapondersteuning een maximale snelheid van 25 kilometer per uur."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f191ceb8-34a3-41e0-93ab-188055da4723",
                        "source_entry_id": "40d533cf-dfa6-3205-a556-7e34e5bb72ba",
                        "source_sense_id": "27d9be40-6317-3017-8274-5296819cc259",
                        "source_sense_description": "een fiets met een elektrische motor",
                        "target_lang_word": "E-Bike",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "E-Bike",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6e564cc-6520-30bf-bdc5-f0a8ff3023e8",
                                        "entry_id": "4ef2f93d-a512-3878-a255-c24bc4f96a93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fahrrad, das mit einem Elektromotor ausgestattet ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88c1cb8c-564e-4159-906c-30e88a8a2f12",
                                                "sense_id": "a6e564cc-6520-30bf-bdc5-f0a8ff3023e8",
                                                "text": "Letztens bin ich doch tatsächlich mit dem E-Bike von Leipzig nach Dresden gefahren."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "688043f5-0645-4d52-bb99-467a817e509a",
                                                "sense_id": "a6e564cc-6520-30bf-bdc5-f0a8ff3023e8",
                                                "text": "„Draußen zieht ein kleines Gewitter vorbei, blöd, wenn man mit dem E-Bike unterwegs ist.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b1bdfcd-5807-4ed3-9e73-d54b276989ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "40d533cf-dfa6-3205-a556-7e34e5bb72ba",
                        "source_sense_id": "27d9be40-6317-3017-8274-5296819cc259",
                        "source_sense_description": "een fiets met een elektrische motor",
                        "target_lang_word": "e-bike",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "e-bike",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                        "entry_id": "cc48f2d3-b1c5-3168-a456-9011afa6fb06",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bicycle powered by an electric motor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17719431-6cb5-4f78-b2c5-210e49fa572c",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "The e-bikes glide past slow, one of the kids turning his bike around. He's tall, with his black hair slicked back with grease, shining in the glow of the other bikes' lights. In the sockets of his eyes she can see only mirrors. Artificial Sonys. The kid's ironed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e3e3763-90e9-4774-a7b7-3dc2f85bdb07",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "ELECTRIC BIKES (\"E-BIKES\") Because e-bike speeds and power are more similar to human-powered bicycles than to motorcycles, I believe their users will need bicycle-style traffic-skills education (Effective Electric Cycling?). I also believe e-bikes, with strict power or acceleration limits, should be allowed to use bike lanes -- think about it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d4763b-5cdb-451e-a0fc-63d10410724f",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "There seems to be a lot of interest emerging about \"E-Bikes.\" I'm not sure of the appropriate place to discuss them. I've seen things on the EV mailing list, and on several .bicycles. groups. Perhaps there is some interest on the hpv mailing list as well--I have't subscribed for a while. Is it worth starting a mailing list or newsgroup for them?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "144e42e7-09df-4a0f-9188-56edb1b4a0ed",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "I've been working on Ebike for 2 years. Read about several attempts around world and US. First patent in 1895. Mine weighs 85 lbs and does help uphill. Working on testing. I decided to build only because I wanted a \"poor person's\" ZEV. Weight will go down with technology over time. No hurry. Lots of stuff to do, learn. No EV is commercially viable in US except trike in Florida. Happy to talk with those interested."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35d2d325-7b7d-4e49-a814-f73d2cfb62d7",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "E-bike info? Anyone have any info on an electric add-on motor for bikes built by a company called \"ZAP\" ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bee2c3ee-1e73-4044-a541-2db179989538",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "My bet is that, in cities at least, the e-car won’t be the vehicle of the future. I suspect it will keep falling further behind e-bikes, e-mopeds and e-scooters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68f115d7-864b-44d0-bfe5-d318117a099c",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "Another important difference: e-bikes can legally travel in the bike lane; scooters and mopeds cannot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67459df7-0ce8-4268-80d8-d2df4b51e86f",
                                                "sense_id": "c93df69a-dc22-393f-9976-7a3226f6370b",
                                                "text": "London Mayor Sir Sadiq Khan said: \"The safety of Londoners is my top priority, and while most e-bikes are safe, there have been a small number of incidents where non-foldable e-bikes have caught fire on the transport system."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
